   "mechanisms_outside_ir": [],
   "notes": "Described the pretrained Llama 2 base family (7B, 13B, 34B, 70B); Llama 2-Chat shares the architecture. 34B and 70B use GQA ('for the 34B and 70B \\cinnamon models we chose to use GQA instead of MQA'); the 8-KV-projection count comes from the GQA description in the same appendix section. 7B/13B use MHA, but their head counts are not stated. This paper does not give d_model, n_layers, n_heads, head_dim, d_ff, the norm eps or the RoPE theta. The architecture is said to follow Llama 1 ('most of'), but those sizes are not restated, so they are left not_stated. The eps 1e-5 in the paper is the AdamW eps, not a norm eps. Vocab is written as '32k' and recorded as 32000. A final RMSNorm in the head is assumed structurally and is not stated. Biases and weight tying are not stated."
  },
